OL,3,AFamily mourn 'deeply loved' girl killed
OL,4,Ain fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a seven-year-old girl
OL,7,Fkilled in a house fire said their lives
OL,8,Fhad been changed forever by her
OL,9,F"devastating loss".
OL,11,FValentina Foster died alongside her
OL,12,Faunt Natalie McDonald, 34, in the blaze
OL,13,Fat Grangetown, near Middlesbrough, in
OL,14,Fthe early hours of 26 August. A man has
OL,15,Fbeen charged with their murders.
OL,17,FIn a tribute, the youngster's parents
OL,18,Fsaid their daughter would "always be in
OL,19,Four hearts, and her memory will live
OL,20,Fwith us forever".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
